SPEC_INDEX TEMPLATE — Agentile.

The canonical inventory of TLA+ specs in this project.

Filled in by `bootstrap.sh` at project setup; updated whenever a
spec is added, renamed, or removed. The CI tooling reads this
file to know which specs to run.

Rename to SPEC_INDEX.md (drop the .template suffix) when you fill
in the placeholders. If your project has zero specs at day zero,
keep this file with an empty inventory — the file's existence is
how the rest of the framework knows the inventory is intentional,
not missing.
-->

